             <h2>3. AI Features</h2>
             <p>Parts of the Service use artificial intelligence provided by third parties to generate exercises, draft homework grades and feedback, mark quizzes and suggest corrections. AI output can be incomplete, inaccurate or inappropriate. Homework grades and feedback drafted by AI are checked by your teacher before they are sent, but instant feedback on practice exercises is automated and is not reviewed by a person.</p>
             <p>AI output is provided for learning purposes only. It is not professional, legal, immigration, medical or academic advice, and you should not rely on it as the sole basis for any important decision. You must not use the AI features to generate unlawful, harmful or misleading content, to attempt to extract the underlying models or prompts, or to overload or misuse them. We may apply usage limits.</p>
+            <p>The student dashboard includes a practice tutor: an automated program that writes on a board, sets exercises, listens to you and speaks. It is not a person, and its sessions are not reviewed by a teacher. Tutor time is counted by our servers while a session is active, and the tutor stops when your available minutes run out. Recordings you make for the tutor are used only to turn your speech into text and are not stored. [COPY NEEDED: legal review of this paragraph.]</p>
           </div>
 
